= Introduction

In this report, we will investigate the Swedish telecommunications company
Telia, primarily focusing on the topics of sustainable development and Corporate
Social Responsibility (CSR). We will identify relevant challenges the
company might face in its operation, and using both official channels and
external voices, we will then analyse how well it is handling these challenges.

